:{"login":"akien-mga","id":4701338,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ3MDEzMzg=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4701338?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga","html_url":"https://github.com/akien-mga","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-02-03T06:19:52Z","updated_at":"2026-02-03T06:20:38Z","body":"Won't that file clash with users' own `.vscode` definitions? Or is that file guaranteed not to be created by anything else than us providing it as a hint?\r\n\r\nIn general I'm not too fond of adding more top-level files/folders if we can avoid it, but I understand the potential benefit there.","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3839303656/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3840722336","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/115538#issuecomment-3840722336","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/115538","id":3840722336,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7k7MWg","user":{"login":"HolonProduction","id":99511741,"node_id":"U_kgDOBe5tvQ","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/99511741?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction","html_url":"https://github.com/HolonProduction","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-02-03T11:21:02Z","updated_at":"2026-02-03T11:21:02Z","body":"> Won't that file clash with users' own `.vscode` definitions? Or is that file guaranteed not to be created by anything else than us providing it as a hint?\r\n\r\nThis files only purpose is to recommend extensions for the workspace. There is nothing stored in it besides those recommendations. It is only created through the explicit `Extensions: Configure Recommended Extensions (Workspace Folder)` command. https://code.visualstudio.com/docs/configure/extensions/extension-marketplace#_workspace-recommended-extensions\r\n\r\nMaybe an actively developed fork might run into a conflict by having the file already :shrug: But I don't think there is any risk of collisions for regular contributors.\r\n\r\n> Is it possible to do this with other editors?\r\n> (jetbrains, sublime text, vim, zed, etc.)\r\n\r\nMost of those come with `.editorconfig` support builtin. The goal here is not to recommend a full opinionated dev env, we have docs for that. But `.editorconfig` in VSCode is kind of a necessity IMO. Fun fact: even the official VSCode Repo [recommends using the edtior config extension](https://github.com/microsoft/vscode/blob/c7f71097f127c68ab2add59efc9f8c7f26848750/.vscode/extensions.json#L6).\r\n\r\n> In general I'm not too fond of adding more top-level files/folders if we can avoid it, but I understand the potential benefit there.\r\n\r\nFair, it might be a bit too obscure.","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3840722336/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4771652773","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/115538#issuecomment-4771652773","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/115538","id":4771652773,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABHGmkpQ","user":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-06-22T18:37:55Z","updated_at":"2026-06-22T18:37:55Z","body":"This has been in limbo for a while, so I'm gonna say that top-level IDE configuration isn't something we're pursuing at this time. Thanks for your contribution!","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4771652773/reactions","total_count":3,"+1":2,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":1,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null}]